{"product":{"id":9728654606561,"title":"MANGO 114","body_html":"<p>The Mango 114 is our widest park platform: a 114mm twin built to treat powder like a park, cultivated with Jake Mageau, the most evolved style in skiing.</p>\n<p>True to a decade-plus of radically rockered roots, the Mango 114 is Jake’s weapon of choice for deep snow. A softer, snappy core flex and aggressively rounded tip taper give it a poppy, stable ride through variable snow. A close-to-center mount and Bi-Radius Sidecut keep it balanced through presses and off-axis rotations. Signature Rocker keeps the feel playful and buttery when the snow stacks up. This is the Mango for progressive skiers who want an XXL park ski to power their style through every condition. Grow your flow.</p>\n<p>Every Mango 114 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon, our proprietary composite weave that improves strength and durability while decreasing weight. Pair that with our trademark 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing, and you have the most durable freestyle powder ski we know how to build.</p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:17:34-07:00","handle":"mango-114","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:30:26-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Mango, Stock Ski","variants":[{"id":49128489877729,"product_id":9728654606561,"title":"176cm","price":"899.00","sku":"27ON3PM114176","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"176cm","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T20:17:34-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":0,"old_inventory_quantity":0,"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"US